      "arabic": "١١٤٢٠- صفية «٤»\n، غير منسوبة، امرأة من الصحابة.\nروى عنها إسحاق بن عبد اللَّه بن الحارث أنها قالت: دخل عليّ رسول اللَّه ﷺ فقربت إليه كتفا فأكل وصلّى ولم يتوضأ. هكذا ذكره أبو عمر مختصرا، وصنيع المزي في التهذيب يقتضي أنها صفية بنت حيي.",
      "english": "11420—Safiyya,(4)\n\nwithout further lineage, a woman from among the Companions.\n\nIshaq ibn Abd Allah ibn al-Harith transmitted from her that she said: “The Messenger of Allah, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, entered upon me, and I brought him a shoulder. He ate and prayed without performing ablution.” This is how Abu Umar mentioned it in abridged form. al-Mizzi's treatment in al-Tahdhib implies that she was Safiyya bint Huyayy.",
      "arabic_sha256": "998f601625056cf3735854fe30962d7dbe0dd6a7a439307a0b098dfe6a338af2",
